@startuml architecture-analysis
!theme plain
title Tender Watch — Self-improvement ("hill-climbing") outer loop

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

actor "Weekly timer\n(168h) /\nPOST /analyze-now" as Trigger
actor "Human reviewer\n(GET /proposals)" as Human

package "loop-orchestrator — Analysis subsystem" {
  component "AnalysisBackgroundWorker" as Worker
  component "AnalysisRunner\n(finds verdict/human\ndisagreements → proposes\na prompt revision)" as Runner
  component "PromptGuardrails\n(pure: rejects a proposal that\ndrops a required safety phrase)" as Guardrails
}

package "Shared with the main loop\n(see architecture-components.puml)" {
  component "ITenderStateStore\n(TableStorageStateStore)" as StateStore
  component "AnthropicClient" as Anthropic
  component "SlackNotifier" as Slack
}

Trigger --> Worker : TryRunOnceAsync()
Worker --> Runner : RunAsync()

Runner --> StateStore : GetRecentAsync(since)\n→ resolved handoffs\n(HandedOff + a human clicked Bid/NoBid)

note right of Runner
  IsDisagreement(): "uncertain" but human
  bid, or "eligible" but human declined.
  Never proposes from a single anecdote —
  needs ≥ MinDisagreementsForProposal
  before spending an LLM call at all.
end note

Runner --> Anthropic : propose a prompt revision\n(target prompt + justification +\ncited tender IDs)

Runner --> Guardrails : IsSafe(targetPrompt, proposedText)
note right of Guardrails
  Required-substring check per prompt —
  e.g. verifier must still contain
  "citedClause" / "Never invent a
  requirement" / "uncertain" — deliberately
  paired with, not a substitute for,
  the human review gate below.
end note

Runner --> StateStore : UpsertProposalAsync\n(Status = Proposed or\nRejectedByGuardrail)

Runner --> Slack : notify human, only if guardrail passed\n(target prompt, justification,\nproposed replacement text)

note right of Slack
  NOT applied automatically — this class
  never writes to PromptBook.cs itself.
  A human must paste the approved text
  in manually. If the guardrail rejected
  the proposal instead, it's persisted
  for audit and this Slack call never
  happens.
end note

Human --> StateStore : reviews via GET /proposals\n(up to 20 most recent)

@enduml
